	(text_box "ACCEPTED RISK:\nD1 clamps at 82.4 V. Downstream absolute maximums:\nDRV8323 VM/VDRAIN   65 V\nLMR36520 VIN        65 V\nTLV75733 VIN       5.5 V (fed from +5V, not exposed)\nD1 therefore does NOT protect the board against an event large\nenough to engage it.\n\nSOLUTION:\nUpstream PDB handles protection"
